      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "HOS",
          "chapter": 13,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "You are destroyed, Israel, because you are against me, against your helper.",
      "ko": "이스라엘아 네가 패망하였나니 이는 너를 도와주는 나를 대적함이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "e38731263b60d1f4a1d5cd92ae53926e9275ea1bf05f5e0ab1bf564525edf628",
      "translation_text_hash": "8297f3c023592f9c9c88c2d1c4f835cacecf8f18308ded40f06c31af95bdbdc7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이스라엘아 네가 패망하였나니 이는 너를 도와주는 나를 대적함이니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "8297f3c023592f9c9c88c2d1c4f835cacecf8f18308ded40f06c31af95bdbdc7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:HOS:13:10",
      "sequence": 22277,
      "chapter_label": "HOS 13",
      "verse_label": "10",
      "locator": {
        "book": "HOS",
